###-------------------------###
### IDEMPOTENCY ###
###-------------------------###
### Финансовые POST-запросы ниже используют Idempotency-Key.
### Для обычного ручного прогона используется {{$guid}}, чтобы каждый запуск создавал новый ключ.
### Если хочешь проверить повторную отправку одной операции, временно замени {{$guid}} в двух одинаковых запросах на один и тот же фиксированный ключ.

###-------------------------###
### HEALTH ###
###-------------------------###

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###-------------------------###
### AUTH / USERS ###
###-------------------------###

### Register user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vkuryndin@gmail.com",
  "username": "volodya",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register duplicate email or username
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser_duplicate",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login by email user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login by username user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login by email user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "vkuryndin@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login by username user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "volodya",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login with wrong password
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### Check auth without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/check

### Check auth with token user 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check auth with token user 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

