### ACCOUNTS ###
###-------------------------###

### Create account user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create second account user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create account user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Get my accounts user 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my accounts user 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Get account by id user 1 account 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get account by id user 1 account 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId2user1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get account by id user 2 account 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### User 1 tries to get user 2 account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### User 2 tries to get user 1 account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Deposit user 1 account 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Deposit user 1 account 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId2user1}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "500.00"
}

### Deposit user 2 account 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Deposit invalid amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "0.00"
}

### Withdraw without MFA should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "10.00"
}

### Request MFA for withdraw user 1 account 1
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "withdraw",
  "account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "250.00"
}

### Withdraw user 1 account 1 with MFA
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "250.00",
  "mfa_code": "219192"
}

### Request MFA for withdraw user 2 account 1
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "withdraw",
  "account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "amount": "250.00"
}

### Withdraw user 2 account 1 with MFA
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "250.00",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### Request MFA for withdraw too much user 1
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "withdraw",
  "account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "999999.00"
}

### Withdraw too much user 1 with MFA
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "999999.00",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### User 2 requests MFA for user 1 account withdraw and should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "withdraw",
  "account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "10.00"
}

### User 2 tries to withdraw from user 1 account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "10.00",
  "mfa_code": "000000"
}

### Check account before close
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close account should work only when balance is 0 and no active/overdue credits exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Account should remain visible after close attempt
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit to closed account should fail if account was closed
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "100.00"
}

### Withdraw from closed account should fail if account was closed
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "10.00",
  "mfa_code": "000000"
}

###-------------------------###
### TRANSFERS WITH MFA ###
###-------------------------###

### Request MFA for transfer between user 1 accounts
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "transfer",
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId2user1}},
  "amount": "100.00"
}

### Transfer between accounts of the same user with MFA
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId2user1}},
  "amount": "100.00",
  "description": "transfer between user 1 accounts",
  "mfa_code": "795010"
}

### Request MFA for transfer from user 1 to user 2
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "transfer",
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "amount": "500.00"
}

### Transfer from user 1 to user 2 with MFA
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "amount": "500.00",
  "description": "transfer from user 1 to user 2",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### Transfer without MFA should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId2user1}},
  "amount": "10.00",
  "description": "missing mfa"
}

### Request MFA for transfer amount binding test
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "transfer",
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "100.00"
}

### Transfer with same MFA but different amount should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "1000.00",
  "description": "wrong operation details",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### Request MFA for transfer too much
### После получения письма обнови @mfaCode перед следующим запросом.
POST {{baseUrl}}/mfa/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "transfer",
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId2user1}},
  "amount": "999999.00"
}

### Transfer too much with valid MFA should fail with insufficient funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId2user1}},
  "amount": "999999.00",
  "description": "too much",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
