### Transfer to same account should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "100.00",
