### Admin users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin logged in users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logged-in-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### User 2 tries admin users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Admin block user 2 account
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit to blocked account should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "100.00"
}

### Transfer from blocked account should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "from_account_id": {{accountId1user2}},
  "to_account_id": {{accountId1user1}},
  "amount": "10.00",
  "description": "blocked account transfer",
  "mfa_code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### Admin block already blocked account should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin unblock user 2 account
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin unblock already unblocked account should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit after unblock should work
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user2}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": "100.00"
}

###-------------------------###
### LOGOUT / REVOKED TOKEN ###
###-------------------------###

### Check auth before logout user 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Logout user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Check auth after logout user 2 should fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
